Prior to the granting of a permit for a parade or marching demonstration within the city limits of this city, an application must be filed at the department of motor vehicles by the person desiring the permit.
(1) The application must set forth the route of the march or demonstration, the hour, date and point of origin of the parade or marching demonstration, the probable duration or period of time required for the parade or marching demonstration from its point of origin to the point of disbanding, and the point of disbanding or dispersing;
